  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "俄羅斯的保守與改革",
    "sub_ename": "RUSSIAN CONSERVATISM AND REFORM",
    "describe_ch": "本課程首先講述數百年來俄羅斯政局的演變，並經由相關影片由淺入深的介紹和觀後之探討，使學生在完成課程後，基本上能夠：\n一、逐步的認識目前全球面積最大的國家於數百年間之地理、歷史、政經文化等發展的狀況。\n二、知悉俄羅斯當權者的領導思維以及全球布局策略，我國可觀摩其技術發展方向及轉化經驗，繼而進一步達到強化自身各項實力的可能性。",
    "describe_eh": "This course begins by exploring the evolution of Russian politics over the past few centuries. Through a series of introductory videos and subsequent discussions, students will be able to:\n1. Gradually understand the geography, history, politics, economy, and culture of the world's largest nation over the past few centuries.\n2. Gain an understanding of the leadership thinking and global strategy of Russian leaders. China can learn from their technological development and transfer experience, thereby further strengthening its capabilities.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "充分了解俄羅斯獨特的歷史背景以及在眾多領域領先各國之緣由。",
      "describe_en": "Fully understand Russia's unique historical background and the reasons why it leads other countries in many fields."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "於國際關係的議題上具有獨立分析和批判思考的能力。",
      "describe_en": "Have the ability to conduct independent analysis and critical thinking on issues related to international relations."
    }
  ],
